Subject: [PATCH 1069/3799] soh: rename D_80B3BF54 -> sDLists

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the tree's main display list per drawType; drawn opaquely when the translucent overlay exists and translucently on its own when it does not.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Wood02/z_en_wood02.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/soh/Enhancements/randomizer/ShuffleTrees.cpp    | 2 +-
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Wood02/z_en_wood02.c | 7 ++++---
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/soh/Enhancements/randomizer/ShuffleTrees.cpp b/soh/soh/Enhancements/randomizer/ShuffleTrees.cpp
index c26e79d1e..5f0381a43 100644
